―}{x}=\\frac{{M}_{O}}{m},\n$$\n\n \n\nwhere \n\n- $m={\\int }_{a}^{b}\\lambda (x)\\,\\text{d}x$ is the mass of the rod,\n\n- ${M}_{O}={\\int }_{a}^{b}\\,x\\lambda (x)\\,\\text{d}x$ is the moment of the rod about the origin $O.$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\lambda (x)=\\frac{1}{{x}^{3}},\\,a=1,\\,b=4.\n$$\n\nSo,  the moment of the rod about the origin is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{O} & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}x\\cdot \\frac{1}{{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[-\\frac{1}{x}]}_{1}^{4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}+1 \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{x}=\\frac{{M}_{O}}{m}=\\frac{(\\frac{3}{4})}{(\\frac{15}{32})}=\\frac{8}{5}.\n$$" 13194139535480 true] [17592186351373 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351374 13194139535480 true] [17592186351373 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351375 13194139535480 true] [17592186351373 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351376 13194139535480 true] [17592186351373 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351377 13194139535480 true] [17592186351373 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351378 13194139535480 true] [17592186351373 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535480 true] [17592186351373 1041 "selection" 13194139535480 true] [17592186351373 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351377 13194139535480 true] [17592186351373 1110 #uuid "8eaa02c2-f3ef-5756-a6a3-3874cf4e1b7c" 13194139535480 true] [17592186351374 1034 "\\frac{7}{4}" 13194139535480 true] [17592186351374 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535480 true] [17592186351374 1111 #uuid "f931466c-2aae-56ac-8d4e-2932f606b89f" 13194139535480 true] [17592186351375 1034 "\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139535480 true] [17592186351375 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535480 true] [17592186351375 1111 #uuid "c0e69c4b-f2fb-56e6-9009-be08e6e2172b" 13194139535480 true] [17592186351376 1034 "\\frac{11}{6}" 13194139535480 true] [17592186351376 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535480 true] [17592186351376 1111 #uuid "1524654e-ddbb-53b9-ac21-8632618dbb35" 13194139535480 true] [17592186351377